  "_comment": [
    "Which spoken phrase each visual lands on. `cue` is a cue id from deck/index.html (a step id plus a short word).",
    "`on` is a word or short phrase from that section of script.md, matched at its first occurrence, ignoring",
    "case and punctuation. `$start` is the section start and `$end` is the end of speech. `offset` shifts the",
    "cue in seconds, and `occurrence` picks a later match. `decktalk beats` reports any phrase it cannot find."
